{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-21","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：比例与整数","englishTitle":"If two mean proportional numbers fall between two numbers, the numbers are similar solid numbers.","book":8,"number":21,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.21","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.21/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":21,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","contentId":"euclid-8-21","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4ada2f10cb2e8057ee0545bc86c298806b098d95dcf4168e468296663ab37bef","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-21.statement","euclid-8-21.construction.1","euclid-8-21.construction.2","euclid-8-21.proof.1","euclid-8-21.construction.3","euclid-8-21.proof.2","euclid-8-21.proof.3","euclid-8-21.proof.4","euclid-8-21.proof.5","euclid-8-21.proof.6","euclid-8-21.proof.7","euclid-8-21.proof.8","euclid-8-21.proof.9","euclid-8-21.proof.10","euclid-8-21.proof.11","euclid-8-21.proof.12","euclid-8-21.proof.13","euclid-8-21.proof.14","euclid-8-21.proof.15","euclid-8-21.proof.16","euclid-8-21.proof.17","euclid-8-21.conclusion","euclid-8-21.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-21.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"85687b824912d1ba2c06aea291f70a6e35e890e328493bd7a4d02358e3f4d749","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two mean proportional numbers fall between two numbers, the numbers are similar solid numbers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个比例中项个数字在两个数字之间下降,数字是相似立体数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"670a66b1abbdb66972bd02a21633d8921a2fae317e5f493dfa6d3d01974f910c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let two mean proportional numbers C, D fall between the two numbers A, B; I say that A, B are similar solid numbers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C,D,D, 两者间A,B; 我说,A,B是相似立体数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ea6b379c392dfc45565a2c805bd9fa3fa9add9fd9cadf4d902d42a89528c2a3e","citations":["euclid-7-33","euclid-8-2","euclid-8-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let three numbers E, F, G, the least of those which have the same ratio with A, C, D, be taken; [[VII. 33](/principles/euclid-7-33) or [VIII. 2](/principles/euclid-8-2)] therefore the extremes of them E, G are prime to one another. [[VIII. 3](/principles/euclid-8-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"取与 A、C、D 具有相同比例的最小三个整数 E、F、G；因此，首项 E 与末项 G 互素。 [VII. 33](/principles/euclid-7-33) [VIII. 2](/principles/euclid-8-2) [[VIII. 3](/principles/euclid-8-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8253947165e837586094ba6fcf9bdfe07f2e15b2ec74d9c905b91ee06385eda2","citations":["euclid-8-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since one mean proportional number F has fallen between E, G, therefore E, G are similar plane numbers. [[VIII. 20](/principles/euclid-8-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于一个比例中项码F 已经下降 E,G, 因此E,G是相似平面数。 [[VIII. 20](/principles/euclid-8-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9d0c44da0407ee4f7efd4f7ffb4feb8c092168453f941c9af22ce5407b48b4a8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let, then, H, K be the sides of E, and L, M of G."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"那么,H,K是E的两边,G的L,M是两边。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ddb2b5b0610844fc737c2ba3a0ea7b4fa1890ccfd6ea422998b1dde9cbd76684","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore it is manifest from the theorem before this that E, F, G are continuously proportional in the ratio of H to L and that of K to M."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,从上述理论中可以看出,E、F、G持续为成比例,比例为H至L,K至M。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"52885f08cd927102ee79ddf351ca0b769dd78806e6005fcaca3c31a6b7d5e15b","citations":["euclid-7-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since E, F, G are the least of the numbers which have the same ratio with A, C, D, and the multitude of the numbers E, F, G is equal to the multitude of the numbers A, C, D, therefore, ex aequali, as E is to G, so is A to D. [[VII. 14](/principles/euclid-7-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,E,F,G是A,C,D中比例相同的人数中最少的,E,F,G中的数量与A,C,D中的数量之多相同,因此,在平等的基础上,E对G的比例等于A对D的比例；E 与 G 之比等于 A 与 D 之比。 [[VII. 14](/principles/euclid-7-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4234f443238978066e39605254fe561ba9a15cbeccb2b7d1f4746d976d3faf31","citations":["euclid-7-21","euclid-7-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But E, G are prime, primes are also least, [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] and the least measure those which have the same ratio with them the same number of times, the greater the greater and the less the less, that is, the antecedent the antecedent and the consequent the consequent; [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)] therefore E measures A the same number of times that G measures D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但E,G是初级,而最低,而与它们具有相同比的至少整除,其数量与数量相同,数量较大,数量较小,数量较小,数量较少,即,前身的前身和随之而来;因此,E,整除,A次与G,整除,D次相同。 [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cb974f7eaf306074cef73933a76b285703acee73a84a39243f8aabc5666f07be","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, as many times as E measures A, so many units let there be in N."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,E 整除 A, 这么多 单位 允许在N。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"be3698131e6aba0029b850691fa87c9cb853e7041ca94bbe0f486ff5bcb3be6a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore N by multiplying E has made A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,N乘以E, 已经产生了A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7bddf12ab4a7611387ccdc642de98c05ede0ab50cde02a2f7dc0d7fb21972e2d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But E is the product of H, K; therefore N by multiplying the product of H, K has made A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但E是H,K的产物,因此N乘以H,K的产物,已生产A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f1d02b09b722b4a1df86ce87d27c8337afef43cfbe2f21dce49d1ef545a85738","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A is solid, and H, K, N are its sides."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A是固体,HK是它的两面。（相关点与线段：N）"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f1b483b235b079dff67cd8431f934d90d34d40cb7eab965bf5fff3a8acfe7094","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since E, F, G are the least of the numbers which have the same ratio as C, D, B, therefore E measures C the same number of times that G measures B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,自E以来,F,G是C,D,B,E,E,C的比例最低,因此,E,整除,C的比例是G,整除,B的比例的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0b0a24657b8e8308d818674585589e11b8cdbead9f4d19c3b8c89d3c1ee7a9f3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, as many times as E measures C, so many units let there be in O."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,E 整除 C, 这么多 单位 允许在O。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ce475b6bb5f9b87c2188b6e1193b981eee9d15478799056dc52b598308be1dd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore G measures B according to the units in O; therefore O by multiplying G has made B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,根据O的单位的数据,G 整除 B是O,因此,O乘以G,使B成为B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2d0fa76a8a9838d30ca06d4a74ed072b6022f2b43097410f28336dc625dbc7fa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But G is the product of L, M; therefore O by multiplying the product of L, M has made B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但G是L,M的产物,因此O乘以L,M的产物,已生产B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4206b46429b3d8017965966516ea7d919938dd6c9aaea782a50e2aa3455be0ec","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore B is solid, and L, M, O are its sides; therefore A, B are solid."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,B是固体,L、M、O是它的两边;A、B是固体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"74104ada75b3dd21944a1e9202a7c59d0e25acd97817c0105c53203fc086e81d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that they are also similar."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,它们也是类似的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"42cb84bcef1bb41dbedc3a633ce19a9abdbfe7dd5009ff8187cef3e05e5dc6cf","citations":["euclid-7-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since N, O by multiplying E have made A, C, therefore, as N is to O, so is A to C, that is, E to F. [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,自N以来,O乘以E,即A,C,N比O等于A比C,即E比F；N 与 O 之比等于 A 与 C 之比。 [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ba7a4fe3fbe9543eeacfebb4059f59ec9fdc88f76e4dc34a3de83573acd22c83","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as E is to F, so is H to L and K to M; therefore also, as H is to L, so is K to M and N to O."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,E对F的比等于H对L和K对M的比;因此,H对L的比等于K对M和N对O的比；E 与 F 之比等于 H 与 L 之比；H 与 L 之比等于 K 与 M 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4018ce1dc8f53d85022efd070cf48bc2fbd71cec88bd1537f2efcd0d4ca9aee3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And H, K, N are the sides of A, and O, L, M the sides of B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"H,K,N是A的两面 O,L,M是B的两面"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":21,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d72662219f7b7ef005964abe1022726eba6f8b8471e5b9d06f1ee121387fa07","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A, B are similar solid numbers. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A,B是相似立体数。 Q. E,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-21.source","contentId":"euclid-8-21","revisionId":"euclid-8-21@raw-4ada2f10cb2e8057","order":22,"kind":"sou